'''Shen Chaos''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Cerebral Citadel}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
'''Shen Chaos''' informs the player of the {{Item|Celestial Timecharm}} after being summoned in the '''First Sequence'''.

